## Concepts

| Page | First Observed | Last Updated | Description |
|------|---------------|-------------|-------------|
| [[narrow-field-of-affordances]] | 2026-10-01 | 2026-10-01 | An environment that provides limited action possibilities, restricting opportunities for the development and exercise of human capacities, a key mechanism through which AI systems can create capacity-hostile environments as detailed in [[ferdman-2026-ai-deskilling-structural-problem]]. Expanded with detailed analysis of characteristics, mechanisms, examples, mitigation strategies, and market research applications from Ferdman's research. |
| [[plan-forming-vs-plan-following]] | 2026-10-01 | 2026-10-01 | The distinction between actively creating plans through self-deliberation (requiring agential control) versus executing pre-determined plans (more habitual), with critical implications for AI's impact on capacity development as analyzed in [[ferdman-2026-ai-deskilling-structural-problem]]. Expanded with detailed analysis of characteristics, AI's impact, market research implications, and mitigation strategies from Ferdman's research. |

## Entities

